Open the sidemenu
Click the WebScan sidemenu entry
Type 1 into the batch_id_start input
Type 20 into the batch_id_end input
Select all from the status dropdown
Select "Begins With" from the search_comment_type dropdown
Type "Search comment" into the search_comment input
# Autocomplete Hart, William into the patient input
Enter "03-01-1981" into the batch_date_start date
Enter "12-30-2000" into the batch_date_end date
Click the Search button
Verify exists @Batch Listview@id=lv_root_Batch
Begin "Setup Enable Clinic Location for Batch Processes System Setting"
	Open the sidemenu
	Click "Control Panel" sidemenu entry
	Click "System" charttab
	Click "System Settings" charttab subtab
	Click "Add System Setting" link
	Enter "Enable Clinic Location for Batch Processes" in the "settings_query" autocomplete
	@Wait@driver.wcutils.waitForAJAX(30)
	Select "1" in the "value" dropdown
	Type "Setup Enable Clinic Location for Batch Processes System Setting" into "reason" input
	Click Add button
Begin "Add Batch with Clinic Location for Testing"
	@Update start date for Better Corp EO@driver.miedb.dbExec("INSERT INTO batches(storage_id, user_id, project, create_user_id, pages) VALUES(281784665, 2, 'OFFICE', 2, 8)")
Begin "Test Clinic Location Search"
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the WebScan sidemenu entry
	Verify exists "Clinic Location:" autocomplete
	Enter "Office" in the "Clinic Location:" autocomplete
	Click the Search button
	Verify exists "Office" listview row
